OL,3,GNEWSAHow a child sports camp shows the
OL,4,Achanging face of grassroots hurling
OL,5,
OL,6,FDark, autumnal nights are not the
OL,7,Ftraditional training time for young
OL,8,Fhurlers and camogs more used to summer
OL,9,Fdays.
OL,11,FBut in Country Down more than 50
OL,12,Fplayers, aged from nine to 12 and from
OL,13,Fsouth Belfast to Strangford village,
OL,14,Fhave been coming to Saintfield for a
OL,15,Fcamp that puts hurls in the hands of
OL,16,Fthe younger generation.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
