OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow a child sports camp shows the
OL,4,Achanging face of grassroots hurling
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmid the echoing thwack of stick on
OL,7,Fball, many at the indoor 3G pitch are
OL,8,Fwearing club jerseys - Carryduff,
OL,9,FDarragh Cross, St Kevin's, RGU,
OL,10,FKilclief and Saul - while others have
OL,11,Fcome to try the sport for the first
OL,12,Ftime.
OL,14,FThe brainchild of the Social Slashers -
OL,15,Fa group of former hurlers based in
OL,16,FSaul, near Downpatrick - the camp
OL,17,Fpoints towards the changing face of the
OL,18,Fsport in the county and beyond.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
